r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_23","text":"The children would be over the moon","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_24","text":"if you were there!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_25","text":"I think so too :D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_26","text":"Sure, I'll help out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_27","text":"Yippee! Thanks, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_28","text":"With the commander, everthing is going smoothly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_29","text":"We'll be in touch.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_seraphim_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_seraphim_02_30","text":"Thanks again!","jump":null}],"chat":true}